      "content": "These feelings of hopelessness and the belief that life is wasted are painful and not uncommon for others struggling with depression, even though they feel vast and impossible. The desire to end the pain can indeed feel urgent when the weight of daily life becomes too heavy to carry alone. I encourage you to lean on a doctor or counselor today to help explain these thoughts and find even a small step toward relief.",
      "source": "target",
