      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am so sorry you are feeling like you have lost control over your life and your own body. This deep sense of having no agency is a heavy and distressing feeling that often accompanies severe depression. Please know that reaching out to a mental health professional is a powerful way to regain that sense of control and find relief from the pain you are carrying. You do not have to go through this alone or feel that your feelings are \"crazy.\"",
      "source": "target",
